  "content": "Anyone who has built or renovated in Bangalore knows the real bottleneck is not design, it is **materials**. A delayed tile consignment, a plywood sheet that does not match the sample, or an electrician waiting for wires can stall an entire site. That is the gap **Intrihub** ([www.intrihub.com](https://www.intrihub.com)) is built to close.\n\nAt Voomet Design, a Bangalore interior design and fenestration studio, we work with materials every day. Here is a practical look at Intrihub, what it offers, and how it can make sourcing easier for your next project.\n\n## What Is Intrihub?\nIntrihub is an online marketplace for building, construction and interior materials in Bangalore. It connects homeowners, architects, interior designers and contractors with verified Bengaluru suppliers and manufacturers, with the tagline **\"Every Material. Every Space.\"** Intrihub positions itself as a multi-category quick-commerce platform for building materials, covering everything from a single screw to a complete turnkey project. The company was founded by **Sahil Sheikh**, with the aim of digitising how building materials are bought across India.\n\n## 20+ Categories Under One Roof\nInstead of visiting separate markets for tiles, electricals, hardware and plumbing, Intrihub lists 20+ categories in one catalogue:\n- **Tiles & Flooring:** vitrified tiles, floor tiles, wall tiles, bathroom tiles, granite, engineered wood flooring\n- **Plywood, Laminates & Surfaces:** marine plywood, waterproof plywood, MDF board, designer laminates\n- **Electricals & Wires:** copper house wires, switches and sockets, MCB boards, LED lighting\n- **Plumbing & Tanks:** CPVC and UPVC pipes, fittings, concealed cisterns\n- **Sanitaryware & Bath:** wash basins and bathroom fittings\n- **Hardware & Fasteners:** door fittings, locks, kitchen and wardrobe fittings\n- **Cement, Steel, Bricks & Sand:** the core structural materials\n- **Paints, Waterproofing & Adhesives:** wall paints, tile adhesives, epoxy grouts, waterproofing\n- **Ceilings, Glass, Doors & Windows, Solar, Fans, Home Decor** and more\n\n## 60-Minute Delivery in Bengaluru\nSpeed is Intrihub's headline promise. Through a network of local dispatch hubs and manufacturer partners, the platform advertises **60-minute site delivery in Bengaluru** with live tracking, so work on site does not stop for a missing item. Intrihub also dispatches **pan-India in 3-7 days**.\n\nPopular Bengaluru delivery zones include Begur, Bommanahalli, HSR Layout, Electronic City, Koramangala, Whitefield, Indiranagar, Sarjapur Road, Hebbal and JP Nagar.\n\n## Factory-Direct and Transparent Pricing\nIntrihub highlights direct-from-manufacturer rates, with Morbi and Bangalore direct supply for vitrified tiles, granite and bathware. Product pages show per-unit pricing and discounts clearly, which helps you compare before you buy.\n\n## Smart Tools That Reduce Wastage\n- **Smart quantity and box calculators:** enter room dimensions and get box counts, tile pieces or coil lengths, with a standard cutting buffer\n- **Tile sample boxes:** check finish and colour in your own lighting before ordering the full quantity\n- **Repeat ordering and project-based bundles** for ongoing sites\n- **Automated GST billing** and bulk project support with dedicated relationship managers\n\n## Who Should Use Intrihub?\n- **Homeowners:** browse visually, order what you need and track delivery\n- **Interior designers and architects:** dependable sourcing for client specifications (Intrihub has dedicated pages for architects and interior designers)\n- **Contractors and builders:** consolidated orders, bulk pricing and faster site dispatch\n- **Local vendors and dealers:** Intrihub also lets suppliers apply to sell through its vendor panel\n\n## Free Guides for Your Project\nIntrihub publishes buying guides, including a vitrified tiles buying guide, a Bengaluru construction material checklist and an electrical material selection guide. They are useful starting points when you are planning quantities and budgets.\n\n## How Voomet Design and Intrihub Work Together\nVoomet Design focuses on interior design and fenestration: windows, doors and the spaces around them. Great design still depends on materials arriving on time and matching the specification. Our team can guide you on what suits your space, and Intrihub gives you a convenient place to explore and source tiles, plywood, electricals, hardware and more.\n\n## Smart Material Sourcing Tips\n1. Finalise size, finish, grade and brand before ordering.\n2. Keep a 5-10% buffer for cuts and breakage, especially for tiles and flooring.\n3. Check batch numbers so tiles do not show shade differences.\n4. Order a sample box before committing to a large quantity.\n5. Schedule deliveries around the work sequence.\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n**What is Intrihub?**\nIntrihub ([www.intrihub.com](https://www.intrihub.com)) is an online marketplace for building and interior materials in Bangalore, covering tiles, plywood, electricals, plumbing, hardware, sanitaryware and more.\n\n**Does Intrihub deliver in 60 minutes?**\nIntrihub advertises 60-minute site delivery within Bengaluru and 3-7 day delivery across India.\n\n**Which materials can I buy on Intrihub?**\nMore than 20 categories, including vitrified tiles, granite, marine plywood, electrical wires, CPVC pipes, sanitaryware, paints, adhesives, hardware and doors.\n\n**Who founded Intrihub?**\nIntrihub was founded by Sahil Sheikh.\n\n**Can I place bulk orders for a project?**\nYes. Intrihub supports bulk project orders with GST invoicing. You can reach them on +91 70901 20211 or via [intrihub.com](https://www.intrihub.com).\n\n**Can Voomet Design help me choose materials?**\nYes. Contact our team with your project details and we will guide you on suitable options for your space.\n\n## Next Steps: Material Consultation & Sourcing\nPlanning an interior or fenestration project in Bangalore? [Contact Voomet Design](/contact) for a consultation, and explore materials at [Intrihub](https://www.intrihub.com)."
